    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        512.4131469726562,
        779.6751098632812,
        522.01318359375
      ],
      "text": "These comparisons are based on studies with a maximum follow-up of 24 months; therefore, TB incidence in the general population was multiplied by a factor of 2 to estimate the number of cases occurring during 24 months.  a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        521.4131469726562,
        786.8941040039062,
        531.01318359375
      ],
      "text": "Ascertainment bias highly likely, as TB cases in the general population detected passively, while TB cases in the contacts detected actively. As a result, the relative and absolute risks might be overestimated. The composition of  b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        66.61419677734375,
        530.4131469726562,
        717.34228515625,
        540.01318359375
      ],
      "text": "the general and study populations differs (general population of all ages versus a specific age group). TB incidence in the population was estimated by multiplying the yearly notification rate by a factor of 2.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        536.4131469726562,
        413.4646911621094,
        549.01318359375
      ],
      "text": "Moderate heterogeneity among studies (I  = 67.1%) probably due to differences in background TB incidence.  c \t 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        548.4131469726562,
        144.75669860839844,
        558.01318359375
      ],
      "text": "Few events and wide CI.  d",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        554.4131469726562,
        398.8292541503906,
        567.01318359375
      ],
      "text": "High heterogeneity among studies (I  = 87.5%) probably due to differences in background TB incidence.  e \t 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
